asgard-gnome-extras (1.0.0) thor; urgency=low

  * Initial @DISTRIBUTION@ "full GNOME beyond core" metapackage.
    Adds the upstream gnome-core → gnome delta: maps, weather, font
    viewer, characters, color manager, initial-setup wizard, RDP
    server, Bluetooth send-to, etc.  Plus seahorse (keyring GUI),
    zenity (dialog helper), fonts-cantarell (GNOME default font).
    Depends on asgard-gnome-desktop so selecting this subcategory
    pulls the GNOME base set automatically.

 -- Athena Build <athena@local>  Mon, 02 Jun 2026 02:00:00 +0000
